<title>UK: FORECAST - Reuters foreign exchange poll - Sept.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Reuters foreign exchange poll - Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar is expected to make little progress against the mark during the next month, according to a Reuter poll of 36 banks annd financial institutions across the globe.</p>
<p>The averages of the forecasts were as follows,</p>
<p>			   1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	 12-MTH</p>
<p>    STERLING/DOLLAR  1.5580     1.5444     1.5253	1.5211</p>
<p>    DOLLAR/MARK	1.4855     1.4974     1.5168	1.5165</p>
<p>    DOLLAR/YEN	 109.27     109.42     109.66	108.48</p>
<p>Using the dollar forecasts above, the cross rates calculate at:</p>
<p>			    1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	12-MTH</p>
<p>    STERLING/MARK    2.3145     2.3126     2.3135	2.3067</p>
<p>    MARK/YEN	    73.55	73.07	72.30	 71.53</p>
<p>At 0935 GMT, the dollar was trading at 1.4844/54 marks and 109.18/26 yen. Sterling/dollar was quoted at $1.5667/77, sterling/mark at 2.3260/70 and mark/yen at 73.51/54.</p>
<p>The minimum and maximum forecasts were as follows --</p>
<p>    STERLING/DOLLAR  1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	 12-MTH</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    1.5000     1.4700     1.4313	1.4100</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    1.5980     1.6200     1.6100	1.6400</p>
<p>DOLLAR/MARK</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    1.4450     1.4000     1.4000	1.3500</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    1.5500     1.5800     1.6000	1.7000</p>
<p>DOLLAR/YEN</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    107.00     104.00     100.00	 92.00</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    112.00     115.75     121.25	121.75</p>
<p>On average the forecasters expect dollar/mark to be trading at 1.4855 one month from now, before rising to 1.5168 in six months. It is expected to be trading at 1.5165 marks in a year from now. The lowest dollar/mark is expected to fall during this period is 1.3500 marks, the highest it is expected to rise is 1.7000.</p>
<p>The dollar is expected to rise slightly against the yen during the months ahead, attaining a level of 109.27 yen in one month from now, before making more progress to end the year at 109.42 yen. In six months time it is seen at 109.66 yen, tailing off to 108.48 in a year's time. The highest forecast for dollar/yen during this period is 121.75 yen, the lowest 92.00.</p>
<p>The poll showed sterling will weaken to $1.5580 one month from now and to weaken further to trade at $1.5211 one year from now. The lowest level sterling is expected to fall is to $1.4100, the highest level 1.7000 in a year from now.</p>
<p>Rankings of the 36 forecasters by the accuracy of their one-month forecasts will be published in the first week of October, just before the results of the next poll.</p>
